4835},\"shorts\":{\"priceLow\":91465.3,\"priceHigh\":91871.8,\"distancePct\":12.75,\"usd\":110502706,\"onTheWayUsd\":261898980},\"longsWithinUsd\":454906314,\"shortsWithinUsd\":417322655,\"liquidationMaxPain\":{\"side\":\"short\",\"bandMidPrice\":91668.6,\"priceLow\":91465.3,\"priceHigh\":91871.8,\"distancePct\":12.75,\"usd\":110502706,\"onTheWayUsd\":261898980}}},\"method\":\"Liquidation max pain within X% of the price: per side, the 0.5% price band where the most position notional is liquidated (longs below the price, shorts above), from the hourly maps of the open positions of Hyperliquid accounts worth $10K or more, its builder dexes included. liquidationMaxPain is the side whose band holds more; onTheWayUsd is every position liquidated between the price and that band's far edge, and bandMidPrice its middle; price is the market's. Smaller accounts and other venues are not in the maps. A different measure from options max pain, the strike where an expiry's options pay their holders least.\",\"receipt\":{\"metric\":\"liquidationLevelsUsd\",\"unit\":\"USD\",\"observationType\":\"modeled\",\"sourceView\":\"hyperliquid_position_map\",\"asOf\":\"2026-10-29T00:00:00Z\",\"venuesIncluded\":[\"hyperliquid\"]}}}"}],"isError":false}}

